      "message_id": "f8cd83ef-35ac-4abe-a96a-3277fb36c577",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Let's explore freely. Perhaps the keeper sent the letter himself; that's a possibility to play with, not a decision."
    },
    {
      "message_id": "1d2cf186-b5d6-411d-9118-7a27fd532635",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "We can keep that as a possibility and explore freely. If he sent it, perhaps the letter was an apology he couldn't make while the recipient was alive. Or perhaps the dead person's name was a way to get the letter into someone else's hands.\n\nThose lead to different kinds of unease: private guilt or a concealed purpose. Neither is decided."
    }
  ],
